<title>USA: Air Express names Declercq as S.African MD.</title>
<headline>Air Express names Declercq as S.African MD.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Connecticut 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Express International said it has named Daniella DeClercq as managing director of its South African operations, based in Johannesburg.</p>
<p>For the past year, DeClercq served as national director of AEI's South African air freight operations. Before that she served nine years as managing director of Profreight Aircargo, a South African air and ocean forwarder acquired by AEI in March 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel:+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
